      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners OBrien Swaine are delighted to present this immaculate, turnkey condition, spacious four-bedroom semi-detached home offering stylish and comfortable family living throughout.\n\nThe property features a beautifully maintained pebbled front lawn with a mature hedged boundary, providing privacy. A generous driveway offers off-street parking for up to three cars.\n\nInside, the welcoming entrance leads to a bright and spacious kitchen/dining area, ideal for family life and entertaining. Double doors open from the Kitchen/Dining area into a comfortable living room, creating a flexible open-plan feel when desired. A convenient guest WC completes the ground floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs, there are four well-proportioned bedrooms, with fitted wardrobes in three of the rooms. The principal bedroom benefits from a private en-suite bathroom, with a modern family bathroom serving the remaining bedrooms.\n\nTo the rear, the property boasts a private patio and garden, providing an ideal outdoor space for relaxing, dining, or entertaining.\n\nThis exceptional home combines generous accommodation, excellent outdoor space, and a high standard of presentation, making it an ideal choice for growing families or anyone seeking a move-in-ready property. Ideally located in one of North Wexford's most sought-after areas, this exceptional home enjoys close proximity to the stunning sandy beaches of Courtown and Ballymoney, offering the perfect setting for coastal walks, swimming, water sports, and family days by the sea.\n\nGolf enthusiasts are exceptionally well catered for, with the renowned Courtown Golf Club and Ballymoney Golf Club both just a short drive away, while the surrounding coastline and countryside provide an abundance of scenic walking and outdoor leisure opportunities.\n\nThe vibrant market town of Gorey is only minutes away and offers an excellent range of amenities including supermarkets, boutiques, cafés, restaurants, schools, medical facilities, sports clubs, and excellent public transport links, making it an ideal location for families and commuters alike.\n\nCombining the tranquility of coastal living with the convenience of nearby town amenities, this superb location offers the very best of the Sunny South East lifestyle. Ideally located in one of North Wexford's most sought-after areas, this exceptional home enjoys close proximity to the stunning sandy beaches of Courtown and Ballymoney, offering the perfect setting for coastal walks, swimming, water sports, and family days by the sea.\n\nServices \nMains "
      },
