        "Content": "Entrance Hall Tiled Floor \nRadiator Cover <br>Living Room Laminate Flooring \nBay Window \nOpen Fire Place <br>Kitchen/Dining Area Laminate Flooring \nFitted Kitchen Units including Oven and Hob, Dishwasher\nDouble Doors to Living Room \nFrench Doors to rear Garden <br>Guest WC Tiled Floor \nWC WHB<br>Master Bedroom Carpet Flooring , \nBay Window\nBuilt in Wardrobe <br>En-suite Tiled Floor and Walls \nShower, WC, WHB<br>Bedroom 2 Timber Flooring \nBuilt in Wardrobes <br>Bedroom 3 Timber Flooring <br>Bedroom 4 Timber Flooring \nWardrobe<br>Bathroom Tiled Floor and walls \nWHB, WC, Double Shower\nTowel Heater\n"
